i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BmDbD2HDOVkQ7kNvwFevyQw&_nc_oc=AdovDhcTOEBD0VPer1fbhg01jzHUCO7t9-UN3zqiMJG6JOYKoEsopIKQRFZKDzRy8ZM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSskWNntMUZJj83FvUsLyVTVyj-RRsX4xPPJJRg5gPAWw&oe=6AF895E3"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YSseRdWYXxQQ7kNvwEhRO8t&_nc_oc=AdoFg81xwkXTc-EOrKya18tAyCMYjVcj6waExNhbRMK2daLJF5uucWDjSc7U6n0spr0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQtBhaGt6xzVwqc1MzKttYUpe2THMV25jWG8DjPk2_PyA&oe=6AF881DD"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IkTFEFTdgBYQ7kNvwH1l4zp&_nc_oc=AdrcQt2WZCy37Gu2XV2ozgNfrPdzmuoOv9Urqa3r-iuCWrOhvYFCRCBQ0dLcJPvGIr0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT61AmwRMjiNIGqUmE9kZue62dmk9H--SYNKvri2NXbWg&oe=6AF8A88A"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im